#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:17
msgid "標準エンタルピー変化"
msgstr "Standard Enthalpy Change"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:19
msgid "始めと終わりの物質が、それぞれの\\ :ref:`標準状態<standard_state>`\\ にあるような過程におけるエンタルピーの変化。"
msgstr ""
"The change in enthalpy for a process in which the initial and final "
"substances are in their respective \\ :ref:`standard states "
"<standard_state>`\\ ."

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:24
msgid "標準反応エンタルピー"
msgstr "Standard Reaction Enthalpy"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:29
msgid "標準生成エンタルピー"
msgstr "Standard Enthalpy of Formation"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:31
msgid "化合物が\\ :ref:`基準状態<reference_state>`\\ にある構成元素から生成するときの標準反応エンタルピー。"
msgstr ""
"The standard reaction enthalpy for forming a compound from its "
"constituent elements in their \\ :ref:`reference states "
"<reference_state>`\\ ."

